  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/07/IMG_9427.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Este viernes ha estado dedicado a los socios en las fiestas de Artesa, pecdan&iacute;a de Onda, con la tradicional cena multitudinaria. Pero tambi&eacute;n ha habido un concierto de rumbas por Ronda 7, organizado por la pe&ntilde;a L&#39;Orinal.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdivendresfestesartesa13/img_9344.jpg\" alt=\"img_9344\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdivendresfestesartesa13/img_9345.jpg\" alt=\"img_9345\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdivendresfestesartesa13/img_9346.jpg\" alt=\"img_9346\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdivendresfestesartesa13/img_9347.jpg\" alt=\"img_9347\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdivendresfestesartesa13/img_9348.jpg\" alt=\"img_9348\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdivendresfestesartesa13/img_9349.jpg\" alt=\"img_9349\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdivendresfestesartesa13/img_9350.jpg\" alt=\"img_9350\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdivendresfestesartesa13/img_9351.jpg\" alt=\"img_9351\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdivendresfestesartesa13/img_9352.jpg\" alt=\"img_9352\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-9